---
// 버전이 하나라도 다르면 그 사람만 못 들어온다는 것을 그림으로 보여준다.
// 글로만 적으면 "최신 버전이면 되겠지" 하고 넘어간다.
---

<svg
  class="dg"
  viewBox="0 0 900 260"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="dg-ver-title dg-ver-desc"
>
  <title id="dg-ver-title">모드 버전이 맞아야 접속됩니다</title>
  <desc id="dg-ver-desc">
    서버와 같은 버전을 설치한 사람은 접속되고, 혼자 더 최신 버전을 설치한
    사람은 같은 모드를 깔았더라도 접속이 거부됩니다.
  </desc>

  <!-- 서버 -->
  <rect x="16" y="76" width="176" height="108" rx="12"
        fill="var(--surface-raised)" stroke="var(--accent)" />
  <text class="t-cap" x="104" y="106">서버가 요구하는 버전</text>
  <rect x="44" y="120" width="120" height="34" rx="8"
        fill="var(--surface-sunken)" stroke="var(--accent)" />
  <text class="t-ver t-on" x="104" y="143">2.0.13</text>

  <!-- 위쪽: 일치 -->
  <g>
    <path d="M200 120 C 250 120, 250 62, 300 62" fill="none"
          stroke="var(--success)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M314 62l-14-7v14z" fill="var(--success)" />

    <rect x="326" y="26" width="300" height="72" rx="12"
          fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--success)" stroke-opacity="0.5" />
    <circle cx="362" cy="62" r="15" fill="var(--surface-raised)" stroke="var(--border-strong)" />
    <circle cx="362" cy="57" r="5" fill="var(--text-faint)" />
    <path d="M353 74a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" fill="var(--text-faint)" />
    <text class="t-name" x="390" y="58">내가 설치한 버전</text>
    <text class="t-verrow" x="390" y="78">2.0.13</text>
    <text class="t-same" x="470" y="78">같음</text>

    <line x1="634" y1="62" x2="666" y2="62" stroke="var(--success)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M680 62l-14-7v14z" fill="var(--success)" />
    <circle cx="710" cy="62" r="16" fill="none" stroke="var(--success)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M703 62l5 6 10-12" fill="none" stroke="var(--success)" stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    <text class="t-good" x="736" y="68">접속됩니다</text>
  </g>

  <!-- 아래쪽: 불일치 -->
  <g>
    <path d="M200 150 C 250 150, 250 198, 300 198" fill="none"
          stroke="var(--warning)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M314 198l-14-7v14z" fill="var(--warning)" />

    <rect x="326" y="162" width="300" height="72" rx="12"
          fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--warning)" stroke-opacity="0.5" />
    <circle cx="362" cy="198" r="15" fill="var(--surface-raised)" stroke="var(--border-strong)" />
    <circle cx="362" cy="193" r="5" fill="var(--text-faint)" />
    <path d="M353 210a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" fill="var(--text-faint)" />
    <text class="t-name" x="390" y="194">친구가 받은 최신 버전</text>
    <text class="t-verbad" x="390" y="214">2.0.14</text>
    <text class="t-diff" x="470" y="214">다름</text>

    <line x1="634" y1="198" x2="666" y2="198" stroke="var(--warning)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M680 198l-14-7v14z" fill="var(--warning)" />
    <circle cx="710" cy="198" r="16" fill="none" stroke="var(--warning)" stroke-width="2" />
    <path d="M704 192l12 12M716 192l-12 12" stroke="var(--warning)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text class="t-bad" x="736" y="196">이 사람만 못 들어옵니다</text>
    <text class="t-note" x="736" y="214">버전이 다르면 막힙니다</text>
  </g>
</svg>

<style>
  .dg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }
  .t-cap { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-dim); text-anchor: middle; }
  .t-ver { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-anchor: middle; }
  .t-on { fill: var(--accent-bright); }
  .t-name { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-dim); }
  .t-verrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--success-bright); }
  .t-verbad { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--warning-bright); }
  .t-same { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--success); }
  .t-diff { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--warning); }
  .t-good { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--success-bright); }
  .t-bad { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--warning-bright); }
  .t-note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-faint); }
</style>
